# LeakSanitizer suppressions. Every entry must say why it is not our bug.
#
# libX11 caches its locale/text-conversion tables for the life of the process and never frees them.
# JUCE reaches that code when it sets the window title (Xutf8TextListToTextProperty). Measured on
# 2026-11-14: ~27 KB, allocated once, does not grow. Suppressed by the JUCE frame, so a real leak
# anywhere else is still reported.
leak:juce::XWindowSystem::setTitle
